---
title: "Linear Algebra"
code: "MTH-266"
category: "mathematics"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/MTH-263"
  - "2026/MTH-264"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: Completion of MTH 263 or equivalent with a grade of B or better or MTH 264 or equivalent with a grade of C or better."
